<header class="kube-library-header">
  <div class="kube-library-container">
    <p class="kube-label">The CloudSecCorner journal</p>
    <h1>Understand more.<br /><span>Build with confidence.</span></h1>
    <p class="kube-library-intro">Practical explanations of AI agent security, cloud architecture, and the decisions behind defensive engineering. Pick a topic, take your time, and keep a useful guide close.</p>
    <div class="kube-library-links"><a href="#guide-library">Browse {length(@posts)} guides ↓</a><a href="/labs/">Prefer hands-on practice? Explore labs →</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="guide-library" class="kube-library-container kube-library-section" data-content-library>
  <div class="kube-library-toolbar">
    <div><p class="kube-label">Read &amp; understand</p><h2>The field guide library</h2></div>
    <div class="kube-library-search" hidden data-library-controls>
      <label for="guide-search">Find a guide</label>
      <input id="guide-search" type="search" placeholder="Search titles, topics, or keywords…" data-library-search />
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-count" role="status" data-library-count>{length(@posts)} guides to explore</p>
  <div class="kube-blog-grid">
    <%= for post <- @posts do %>
      <article class="kube-blog-card" data-library-card>
        <div class="kube-blog-card-top"><p class="kube-label">{post["category"] || "Field notes"}</p><time>{post["date"]}</time></div>
        <h3><a href={"/blog/#{post["id"]}/"}>{post["title"]}</a></h3>
        <p>{post["excerpt"]}</p>
        <div class="kube-blog-card-tags">
          <%= for tag <- Enum.take(post["tags"] || [], 3) do %>
            <span>{tag}</span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-empty" hidden data-library-empty>No guides matched that filter. Try a broader search term.</p>
</section>

<section class="kube-contribute">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 lg:py-14">
    <div class="kube-contribute-copy">
      <p class="kube-label">Share with the community</p>
      <h2>Have an engineering lesson or teardown to publish?</h2>
      <p>Contribute a field note, security analysis, or architecture teardown for engineers building and defending autonomous cloud systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kube-contribute-actions">
      <a class="kube-contribute-primary" href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Contribution guide ↗</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/issues/new/choose" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Submit a post ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
